  "configuration_id": "config_002",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only PCA singleprofile substantially outperforms image-only ResNet singleprofile, so RNA is the stronger modality, but it is unclear whether multiprofile aggregation improves RNA performance. config_002 tests this by keeping the same RNA encoder and modality while moving to multiprofile with the simplest avgpool aggregation, isolating the profile/aggregation effect as much as possible. It is the best next experiment because it exploits the promising RNA direction with a minimal change; if it helps, it justifies testing transformer aggregation or multimodal multiprofile extensions, and if it does not, it indicates singleprofile may be sufficient before adding complexity."
}

